{
  "id": "mfl-live",
  "name": "MFL Live",
  "description": "The AFL design language with the navy family replaced by neutral near-black, keeping the red accent and the gold family. Applied by MflAppLayout to the shared-host app, which is not a registry league.",
  "notes": {
    "--color-primary": "Dark uses TWO reds. FILL #d81b41 carries white at 5.06:1 and stands 3.19:1 off the #1e2126 card; TEXT #ef5350 (--league-accent) is 4.63:1 on the card but carries white at only 3.49:1, so it is never the button.",
    "--color-primary-light": "Light value is deliberately DARKER than --color-primary despite the name: it feeds --link-color-accent, text on a white card, and the lighter step (#e04a60) is 3.95:1.",
    "--color-text-primary": "Defined in light too (the theleague theme leaves it unset there): mfl-live.css reads it with no fallback, and undefined, colour inherits and the board loses its text hierarchy."
  },
